        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions DRB4004004BR, Contemporary Sliding Pocket Door Flush Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Contemporary Pocket Door Flush Pull  is a great addition to any sliding door. A beautiful way to add modern style to your home, the Darby 4 Flush Pull comes with all the necessary mounting hardware. The Modern Pocket Door Pull is made from solid brass; choose from a wide array of finishes including satin brass and polished chrome. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis flush pull has a 90 degree bend that wraps 1/4\" on to the door's edge. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis Contemporary Style Pocket Door Hardware is also available as a <a href=\"/products/contemporary-pocket-door-privacy-lock-first-impressions-drb4004brpvc\"><b>Privacy Lock Set</b></a> and <a href=\"/products/contemporary-pocket-door-passage-set-first-impressions-drb4004brpsg\"><b>Passage Lock Set</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the First Impressions DRB4004004BR Darby Collection Series 4 Contemporary Flush Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Total Height: 4-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Width: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Depth: 5/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Cutout Depth: 3/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Cutout Height: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Cutout Width: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-DRB04-specifications.pdf?v=1704262225\"><b>First Impressions DRB4004004BR Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nPackaged as a set that includes 2 flush pulls. <b>For One (1) Door.</b>\r\n</p>",
